1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The closest thing adult friendship
has to a cheat code:

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Become a regular somewhere.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Same run club.
Same class.
Same community night. Weekly.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Visit one: you're a stranger.
Visit two: you're familiar.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,500
Visit three: people expect you. And expected people get invited to things.

6
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,500
Novelty feels productive.
Repetition actually works.

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Pick your place this week. Save this for Friday night.
